:: Widgets DoLX Changelog [widget]
<<widget "DoLXChangelog">>
	<div class="changelog-overlay">
		<div class="changelog-hero">
			<span class="changelog-hero-icon" aria-hidden="true">&#128220;</span>
			<div>
				<div class="changelog-label">PATCH NOTES</div>
				<h1>DoL X-Change <span>Changelog</span></h1>
				<div class="changelog-apk-note"><strong>Official X-Change APK:</strong> Join the DoL Modding server and check the dedicated <a href="https://discord.com/channels/675158131688603721/1512272787572785162" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">X-Change Channel</a>.</div>
			</div>
		</div>
		<a class="changelog-release-link" href="https://gitgud.io/Akoz/dol-xchange/-/releases" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span aria-hidden="true">&#128279;</span> View the full changelog and all releases <span aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span></a>
		<h2><span class="changelog-section-icon new" aria-hidden="true">&#10022;</span> Changes and Additions</h2>
		<ul>
			<li>Updated vanilla version to 0.5.13.8. Thanks to Reiyu.</li>
			<li>Updated Reiyu's Bailey Expansion to v0.6.3.3. Thanks to Reiyu.</li>
		</ul>
		<h2><span class="changelog-section-icon fixes" aria-hidden="true">&#9874;</span> Fixes and Improvements</h2>
		<ul>
			<li><strong>Thanks to VonChair</strong>
				<ul>
					<li>Fixed the bus seat "Event pool is empty" error.</li>
					<li>Fixed a stray '>' sign in a school skill line.</li>
					<li>Fixed doubled odds of the street wanted poster event.</li>
					<li>Optimised custom makeup preview redraw issue that ocassionally caused errors.</li>
					<li>Fixed cheat teleport for the moor and sea. Landmark locations should now appear properly where expected.</li>
					<li>Fixed Colosseum breeding ending that often resulted in no impregnation. Arousal now carries over from the fight into the breeding scene.</li>
					<li>Added stim option for autistic PCs at the island camp.</li>
					<li>Swarm encounters with the Critter Magnet trait should no longer always end with the player passing out from stress.</li>
					<li>Pets no longer starve while in transit to or during your stay at the island.</li>
					<li>Blindfold adaptability may now be made permanent with some hypnotic help from Gwylan.</li>
					<li>Fixed issue causing the prison to not be considered a bad end codewise when ending there as a result of the bank heist or Whitney arrest routes.</li>
					<li>Dildos and fetish dildo chastity belts may now be used to fully seal-in lewd fluids within your vagina.</li>
				</ul>
			</li>

		</ul>
	</div>
<</widget>>
